• Pairwise Trade-off Projections: The pairwise projections in Figure 1c and Figure 1d further elucidate the underlying trade-off dynamics across resilience and sustainability dimensions. Specifically, Figure 1c demonstrates the non-linear relationship between expected total cost (
Z 1
